<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．每校每个学科教学论文可报送数≤<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>篇；教育专项论文<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>案例<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>每个项目可报送数≤<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>篇。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．论文要突出主题、言之有据、语言简洁、表述规范，字数不超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>6000</SPAN>字。以课题报告、调研报告形式撰写的，不予评奖。参评论文需要提交纸质稿一式<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>份（<SPAN lang=EN-US>word</SPAN>排版，<SPAN lang=EN-US>A4</SPAN>纸打印，左上角注明参评论文的类别，其中<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>份注明名单位、姓名、联系电话等信息，其余<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>份不署名），正文中不得出现作者姓名、单位、联系电话等信息。同一作者两个类别的论文最多各报送<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>篇，同一篇论文只能参加一个类别的评比。参评篇目表及论文电子稿发送各相关联系人。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">评比承诺。凡参加教育教学论文评比的作者，须填写《绍兴市教育教学论文评比承诺书》（见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>），承诺其教育教学论文的原创性、真实性，同意在市教研网上公开论文，并经由所在单位签署意见，加盖公章。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">若发现诚信缺失等问题，对责任人进行通报，并在三年内不予参加绍兴市直级及以上相关教学评比活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">二、“品质课堂”评比</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>（一）优质课评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．评比原则<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>突显“倡导教育理念、突出具体专题、结合教学问题、融入研究视角、体现公平公正”的基本原则。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．评比时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>市直优质课评比在<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>～<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月份举行，各校在校级评比推荐基础上，将参评名单（见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）于<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日前以校为单位报送教育教学研究院邵乃军老师处（电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>88909397</SPAN>，邮箱：<SPAN lang=EN-US>snj8@163.com</SPAN>），有关学科教研组长请同时将学科参评教师名单告知相关学科教研员。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．参评对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>高中各学科：语文、数学、英语、物理、化学、生物、思想政治、历史、地理、体育与健康、通用技术、信息技术、心理健康、生涯规划。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>推荐数：各校每科限报<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>节，允许缺报。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．评比形式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>评比将采用现场教学活动的形式，具体程序为：在活动开始前<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>天公布教学内容；参评教师次日一早进行抽签，然后按抽签顺序进行教学活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">．取奖上限<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>各学科按照一、二等奖比例<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>取奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=Calibri>（二）录像课评比<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>本学期暂缓<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
